# Build context filter for infra/docker/web.Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.vite
.git
.claude
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
docs/reference
contracts/python
stats/scoring
stats/validation
stats/simulator
stats/rbridge
backend/api/**
# The admin pages read the retention schedule at build time (load-settings.server.ts).
!backend/api/src/shriii_api/config/
!backend/api/src/shriii_api/config/*.yaml
frontend/apps/kiosk/electron/dist
infra/tofu
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
